[statement]
As
`a-later-name-whose-best-candidate-needs-a-candidate-steers-an-earlier-one`,
with the dependency answered by two versions of one package: `pjackdev`,
the best candidate for `Pc`, needs `pjack`, every version of which
provides `So` at a version, as `jack` does. `So`, decided first, takes
`pjack` 1.6, the best of them.

